final_justification.value:
Before rebuttal, my major concerns are (1) insufficient dataset size; (2) lack of comparisons with other VLM annotation systems.

In the rebuttal phase, the authors have provided sufficient materials, which include: (1) a comprehensive design to scale up the dataset size; (2) comparison of their scores with Gemini, GPT4o, and GPTo3 scores;

These two additional materials help address my concerns. Considering the fact that dataset scaling is a to-do work, I decided to maintain my score as **5, accept**.

